{
    "title": "Volume Bass Booster, Equalizer",
    "description": "Longing for a boost in music volume?\r\nCraving an immersive musical experience that resonates with your soul?\r\n\r\nHere comes Volume Bass Booster, Equalizer, <b><u>a collective of Bass Booster, Music Equalizer and Volume Booster for Android phone</u></b>, designed to elevate your music experience. Not only does this sound booster offer an array of equalizer effects to suit your music taste, but also can amplify your system volume up to 200%.\r\n\r\nWait no more! Download Volume Bass Booster, Equalizer now and embark on an extraordinary music journey!\r\n\r\n\r\n<b># MAIN FEATURES:</b>\r\n\r\n- Advanced equalizer with 20+ preset effects\r\n- Built-in bass booster and 3D virtualizer\r\n- Volume booster for all devices: phones, speakers, headphones, etc.\r\n- Customizable music effect to suit your personal taste\r\n- Choose between 10-band and 5-band equalizer\r\n- Cool edge lighting & sound spectrum pulsing with the music beat\r\n- Quick control via home screen widgets and notification bar\r\n- Background and lock screen support for uninterrupted listening\r\n- Convenient built-in music player control\r\n- User-friendly interface\r\n\r\n\r\n<b># WHY CHOOSE \u201cVOLUME BASS BOOSTER, EQUALIZER\u201d?</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Advanced Music Equalizer</b>\r\nSwitch between 10-band and 5-band equalizer to customize your music experience as needed. Explore 20+ preset reverb effects (classical, dance, folk, heavy metal, hip hop, etc.) and 3D virtualizer to match your music genres perfectly.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Powerful Bass Booster</b>\r\nFeel the music come alive with our professional bass booster. Simply rotate the button to adjust the bass and immerse yourself in the deep, resonant rhythm as it pulses through your device.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Superior Volume Booster</b>\r\nExperience a volume boost with just one tap, whether you're listening to music, watching videos, or playing games, through speakers or headset, all without compromising sound quality.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Built-in Music Player Controls</b>\r\nEasily manage your music playback directly within this sound booster. View song covers, titles, and artists, play/pause tracks, and seamlessly switch between songs with ease.\r\n\r\n\r\nDownload Volume Bass Booster, Equalizer today to unlock an extraordinary audio experience! Say goodbye to mediocre sound quality and prepare for an immersive musical journey with this powerful sound amplifier!\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or suggestions while using our app, please feel free to contact us via eqboosterfeedback@gmail.com.\r\n\r\n\r\nSound Booster for Audio Enhancement\r\nIf you're looking for a loudness enhancer, don't miss this equalizer sound booster. With 20+ equalizer fx, this loud speaker booster can provide you with an extraordinary music experience. And it's also a bass booster for headphones.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Longing for a boost in music volume?<br>Craving an immersive musical experience that resonates with your soul?<br><br>Here comes Volume Bass Booster, Equalizer, <b><u>a collective of Bass Booster, Music Equalizer and Volume Booster for Android phone</u></b>, designed to elevate your music experience. Not only does this sound booster offer an array of equalizer effects to suit your music taste, but also can amplify your system volume up to 200%.<br><br>Wait no more! Download Volume Bass Booster, Equalizer now and embark on an extraordinary music journey!<br><br><br><b># MAIN FEATURES:</b><br><br>- Advanced equalizer with 20+ preset effects<br>- Built-in bass booster and 3D virtualizer<br>- Volume booster for all devices: phones, speakers, headphones, etc.<br>- Customizable music effect to suit your personal taste<br>- Choose between 10-band and 5-band equalizer<br>- Cool edge lighting &amp; sound spectrum pulsing with the music beat<br>- Quick control via home screen widgets and notification bar<br>- Background and lock screen support for uninterrupted listening<br>- Convenient built-in music player control<br>- User-friendly interface<br><br><br><b># WHY CHOOSE \u201cVOLUME BASS BOOSTER, EQUALIZER\u201d?</b><br><br>\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Advanced Music Equalizer</b><br>Switch between 10-band and 5-band equalizer to customize your music experience as needed. Explore 20+ preset reverb effects (classical, dance, folk, heavy metal, hip hop, etc.) and 3D virtualizer to match your music genres perfectly.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Powerful Bass Booster</b><br>Feel the music come alive with our professional bass booster. Simply rotate the button to adjust the bass and immerse yourself in the deep, resonant rhythm as it pulses through your device.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Superior Volume Booster</b><br>Experience a volume boost with just one tap, whether you&#39;re listening to music, watching videos, or playing games, through speakers or headset, all without compromising sound quality.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Built-in Music Player Controls</b><br>Easily manage your music playback directly within this sound booster. View song covers, titles, and artists, play/pause tracks, and seamlessly switch between songs with ease.<br><br><br>Download Volume Bass Booster, Equalizer today to unlock an extraordinary audio experience! Say goodbye to mediocre sound quality and prepare for an immersive musical journey with this powerful sound amplifier!<br><br>If you have any questions or suggestions while using our app, please feel free to contact us via eqboosterfeedback@gmail.com.<br><br><br>Sound Booster for Audio Enhancement<br>If you&#39;re looking for a loudness enhancer, don&#39;t miss this equalizer sound booster. With 20+ equalizer fx, this loud speaker booster can provide you with an extraordinary music experience. And it&#39;s also a bass booster for headphones.",
